dsh-md-html-render README · Migrate：`md_html_render` still exists, with the same parameters (`markdown`, `title`, `save_path`) and the same return shape. As of v0.3.0 the package name is unchanged too — only the location it resolves from moves:

```jsonc
// ~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/package.json
{
  "dependencies": {
-   "dsh-md-html-render": "github:LeslieWylie/dsh-md-html-render",

Then `pnpm install` in the profile directory and restart.

dsh-md-html-render README · 迁移：`md_html_render` 依然存在，参数（`markdown`、`title`、`save_path`）和返回结构都不变；自 v0.3.0 起包名也不变，变的只是它从哪里解析：

```jsonc
// ~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/package.json
{
  "dependencies": {
-   "dsh-md-html-render": "github:LeslieWylie/dsh-md-html-render",

然后在 profile 目录执行 `pnpm install` 并重启。

